# Constraint

C2: Sort with a merge sort you wrote yourself: split the range, sort both halves, merge them (top-down or bottom-up). Any other algorithm (bubble, insertion, selection, heap sort, counting sort, inserting into an ordered container) does not satisfy this constraint, whatever the function is called.

